   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Organisation des Nations unies pour l&apos;&#xe9;ducation, la science et la culture (UNESCO)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Educational, Scientific and Cultural Organization (UNESCO)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Office Capacities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The principle purpose of this project is to strengthen the activities of the UNESCO Regional Bureau for Science and Culture in Europe through the building of Office Capacities as agreed by the Governance Bodies of the Bureau (Scientific Council and Steering Committee). This project will allow the Director and staff of the Bureau to travel and undertake activities relevant to the execution of the approved programmes. In addition, this project intends to provide the Bureau with the human and financial resources necessary to run the Bureau and its activities, as recommended by the Gov. Bodies and approved by the DG.</narrative>
  </description>
